@cindex TDM support
@cindex The Disintegrated Machine support
TDM (The Disintegrated Machine) is a 16-bit, word addressed processor
with four registers and a single 16-bit instruction format.

@menu
* TDM Syntax::               Syntax
* TDM Word Addressing::      Word Addressing
* TDM Opcodes::              Opcodes
* TDM Relocations::          Relocations
@end menu

@node TDM Syntax
@section Syntax
@menu
* TDM Chars::                Special Characters
